    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0 \\text{ m}\"></span> (or equilibrium position) [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>- Use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k = \\frac{F}{x}\"></span> with any pair of values from the table (e.g., <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{0.50}{0.02}\"></span> or <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2.00}{0.08}\"></span>) [1 mark]<br/>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k = 25 \\text{ N m}^{-1}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>- Calculate angular frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega = \\sqrt{\\frac{k}{m}} = \\sqrt{\\frac{25}{0.25}} = 10 \\text{ rad s}^{-1}\"></span> [1 mark]<br/>- Calculate frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f = \\frac{\\omega}{2\\pi} = \\frac{10}{2\\pi} \\approx 1.6 \\text{ Hz}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong></p><p>- <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E = \\frac{1}{2} k A^2 = 0.5 \\times 25 \\times (0.08)^2 = 0.080 \\text{ J}\"></span> [1 mark]</p></section>"
