  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A mass of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.25 \\text{ kg}\"></span> is attached to a horizontal spring on a frictionless surface. The mass is displaced and then released so that it undergoes simple harmonic motion. The following table shows the magnitude of the restoring force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acting on the mass at various displacements <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> from the equilibrium position.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Displacement <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10^{-2} \\text{ m}\"></span></th><th>Restoring Force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{N}\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.00\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.50\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.00\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong> </p>State the displacement of the mass at which the kinetic energy of the system is at a maximum.<p>[1]</p></section><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong> </p>Use the data in the table to determine the spring constant <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"k\"></span> of the spring.<p>[2]</p></section><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong> </p>Calculate the frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> of the oscillations.<p>[2]</p></section><section class=\"question-part\" data-label=\"d\"><p><strong>d</strong> </p>Determine the total energy of the oscillations for an amplitude of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8.0 \\text{ cm}\"></span>.<p>[1]</p></section>"
